<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID TO BUY PLN 406 MLN OF POLISH BONDS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID TO BUY PLN 406 MLN OF POLISH BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid to buy 406 million zlotys worth of Polish 12-percent five-year bonds, maturing June 12, 2001, at a tender for institutional investors against a 300 million zloty offer, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction will be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
